{"id": 268, "date": "2026-10-01T15:41:58", "date_gmt": "2026-10-01T15:41:58", "guid": {"rendered": "https://medluxlife.de/health/hospital-specialist-treatments/medical-oncology/", "raw": "https://medluxlife.de/health/hospital-specialist-treatments/medical-oncology/"}, "modified": "2026-10-07T18:20:40", "modified_gmt": "2026-10-07T18:20:40", "password": "", "slug": "medical-oncology", "status": "publish", "type": "page", "link": "https://medluxlife.de/health/hospital-specialist-treatments/medical-oncology/", "title": {"raw": "Medical Oncology", "rendered": "Medical Oncology"}, "content": {"raw": "<!-- wp:columns {\"verticalAlignment\":\"center\",\"className\":\"medlux-intro\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-columns are-vertically-aligned-center medlux-intro\"><!-- wp:column {\"verticalAlignment\":\"center\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-column is-vertically-aligned-center\"><!-- wp:paragraph {\"className\":\"medlux-lead\"} -->\n<p class=\"medlux-lead\">Cancer treatment is planned according to the type, stage and biological features of the disease and your personal situation. Through our partner hospital, your case is assessed by a multidisciplinary team in which medical oncologists work closely with surgeons, radiation oncologists and other specialists.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n<!-- /wp:column -->\n\n<!-- wp:column {\"verticalAlignment\":\"center\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-column is-vertically-aligned-center\"><!-- wp:image {\"id\":406,\"sizeSlug\":\"large\",\"linkDestination\":\"none\",\"className\":\"medlux-intro-img\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large medlux-intro-img\"><img src=\"https://medluxlife.de/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/medluxlife-hospital-oncology.jpg\" alt=\"Woman in a headscarf smelling yellow tulips, cancer care theme\" class=\"wp-image-406\"/></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image --></div>\n<!-- /wp:column --></div>\n<!-- /wp:columns -->\n\n<!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"medlux-section\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"constrained\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group medlux-section\"><!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Treatments and services</h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"medlux-treatment-grid\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"grid\",\"minimumColumnWidth\":\"20rem\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group medlux-treatment-grid\"><!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"medlux-card\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"constrained\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group medlux-card\"><!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Personal treatment planning</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>A treatment plan tailored to the type and stage of the disease, agreed in cooperation with surgery, radiation oncology and other departments.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group -->\n\n<!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"medlux-card\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"constrained\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group medlux-card\"><!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Chemotherapy</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Drug treatments that stop the growth of cancer cells or destroy them, planned individually.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group -->\n\n<!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"medlux-card\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"constrained\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group medlux-card\"><!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Targeted therapy</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Medicines that act on specific features of cancer cells, used where the tumour biology makes them suitable.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group -->\n\n<!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"medlux-card\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"constrained\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group medlux-card\"><!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Immunotherapy</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Treatments that help the immune system to recognise and fight cancer cells.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group -->\n\n<!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"medlux-card\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"constrained\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group medlux-card\"><!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Hormone therapy</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Used for hormone-sensitive cancers, such as some breast and prostate cancers.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group -->\n\n<!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"medlux-card\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"constrained\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group medlux-card\"><!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Follow-up and supportive care</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Regular follow-up, management of side effects, preserving quality of life and psychosocial support during treatment.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group -->\n\n<!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"medlux-section medlux-columns\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"constrained\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group medlux-section medlux-columns\"><!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Cancer types treated</h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Our partner oncology team treats the following cancers, as well as many other cancer types:</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\"><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Lung cancer</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Head and neck tumours</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Brain tumours</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Kidney cancer</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Endometrial (uterine) cancer</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Liver cancer</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Lymphomas</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Malignant melanoma</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Breast cancer</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Bladder cancer</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Gastrointestinal cancers</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Multiple myeloma</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Osteosarcoma and soft tissue sarcomas</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Ovarian cancer</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Pancreatic cancer</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Prostate cancer</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Gallbladder and biliary tract cancer</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Cervical cancer</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Testicular cancer</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Thyroid cancer</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group -->\n\n<!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"medlux-section\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"constrained\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group medlux-section\"><!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Before you travel</h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>To get a reliable medical opinion quickly, please prepare:</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\"><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Recent medical reports and discharge summaries</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Imaging (MRI, CT, X-ray) on CD or as DICOM files, with the radiology reports</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Recent laboratory results</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>A list of your current medications and any allergies</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Pathology report and, if available, tissue blocks or slides</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group -->\n\n<!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"medlux-section\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"constrained\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group medlux-section\"><!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">How MedLuxLife supports you</h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"medlux-steps\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"grid\",\"minimumColumnWidth\":\"20rem\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group medlux-steps\"><!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"medlux-card\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"constrained\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group medlux-card\"><!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">1. Free consultation</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Share your wishes and, if available, recent X-rays or photos. We answer your questions and explain the options.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group -->\n\n<!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"medlux-card\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"constrained\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group medlux-card\"><!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">2. Personal treatment plan</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Our partner specialists prepare a treatment plan and an estimated timeline tailored to you.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group -->\n\n<!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"medlux-card\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"constrained\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group medlux-card\"><!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">3. Travel &amp; treatment</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>We coordinate your appointments, hotel and airport transfers, so you can focus on your treatment.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group -->\n\n<!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"medlux-card\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"constrained\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group medlux-card\"><!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">4. Aftercare</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>We stay in touch after you return home and help with follow-up questions.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group -->\n\n<!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"medlux-cta\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"constrained\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group medlux-cta\"><!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Plan your oncology consultation with confidence</h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Every treatment begins with a personal, no-obligation consultation. Contact us and we will get back to you as soon as possible.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:buttons -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-buttons\"><!-- wp:button {\"className\":\"medlux-btn-primary\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-button medlux-btn-primary\"><a class=\"wp-block-button__link wp-element-button\" href=\"https://medluxlife.de/contact/\">Request a Free Consultation</a></div>\n<!-- /wp:button --><!-- wp:button {\"className\":\"medlux-btn-whatsapp\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-button medlux-btn-whatsapp\"><a class=\"wp-block-button__link wp-element-button\" href=\"https://wa.me/380979092326\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">WhatsApp</a></div>\n<!-- /wp:button --></div>\n<!-- /wp:buttons -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"className\":\"medlux-disclaimer\"} -->\n<p class=\"medlux-disclaimer\">The information on this page is for general guidance only and does not replace a medical consultation. Suitability for any treatment is assessed individually by a qualified doctor.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group -->", "rendered": "\n<div class=\"wp-block-columns are-vertically-aligned-center medlux-intro is-layout-flex wp-container-core-columns-is-layout-e35d3e13 wp-block-columns-is-layout-flex\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-column is-vertically-aligned-center is-layout-flow wp-block-column-is-layout-flow\">\n<p class=\"medlux-lead wp-block-paragraph\">Cancer treatment is planned according to the type, stage and biological features of the disease and your personal situation. Through our partner hospital, your case is assessed by a multidisciplinary team in which medical oncologists work closely with surgeons, radiation oncologists and other specialists.</p>\n</div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-column is-vertically-aligned-center is-layout-flow wp-block-column-is-layout-flow\">\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large medlux-intro-img\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"720\" height=\"400\" src=\"https://medluxlife.de/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/medluxlife-hospital-oncology.jpg\" alt=\"Woman in a headscarf smelling yellow tulips, cancer care theme\" class=\"wp-image-406\" srcset=\"https://medluxlife.de/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/medluxlife-hospital-oncology.jpg 720w, https://medluxlife.de/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/medluxlife-hospital-oncology-300x167.jpg 300w, https://medluxlife.de/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/medluxlife-hospital-oncology-18x10.jpg 18w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 720px) 100vw, 720px\" /></figure>\n</div>\n</div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-group medlux-section has-global-padding is-layout-constrained wp-block-group-is-layout-constrained\">\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Treatments and services</h2>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-group medlux-treatment-grid is-layout-grid wp-container-core-group-is-layout-5e4b10ce wp-block-group-is-layout-grid\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-group medlux-card has-global-padding is-layout-constrained wp-block-group-is-layout-constrained\">\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Personal treatment planning</h3>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">A treatment plan tailored to the type and stage of the disease, agreed in cooperation with surgery, radiation oncology and other departments.</p>\n</div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-group medlux-card has-global-padding is-layout-constrained wp-block-group-is-layout-constrained\">\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Chemotherapy</h3>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Drug treatments that stop the growth of cancer cells or destroy them, planned individually.</p>\n</div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-group medlux-card has-global-padding is-layout-constrained wp-block-group-is-layout-constrained\">\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Targeted therapy</h3>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Medicines that act on specific features of cancer cells, used where the tumour biology makes them suitable.</p>\n</div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-group medlux-card has-global-padding is-layout-constrained wp-block-group-is-layout-constrained\">\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Immunotherapy</h3>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Treatments that help the immune system to recognise and fight cancer cells.</p>\n</div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-group medlux-card has-global-padding is-layout-constrained wp-block-group-is-layout-constrained\">\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Hormone therapy</h3>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Used for hormone-sensitive cancers, such as some breast and prostate cancers.</p>\n</div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-group medlux-card has-global-padding is-layout-constrained wp-block-group-is-layout-constrained\">\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Follow-up and supportive care</h3>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Regular follow-up, management of side effects, preserving quality of life and psychosocial support during treatment.</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-group medlux-section medlux-columns has-global-padding is-layout-constrained wp-block-group-is-layout-constrained\">\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Cancer types treated</h2>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Our partner oncology team treats the following cancers, as well as many other cancer types:</p>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li>Lung cancer</li>\n\n<li>Head and neck tumours</li>\n\n<li>Brain tumours</li>\n\n<li>Kidney cancer</li>\n\n<li>Endometrial (uterine) cancer</li>\n\n<li>Liver cancer</li>\n\n<li>Lymphomas</li>\n\n<li>Malignant melanoma</li>\n\n<li>Breast cancer</li>\n\n<li>Bladder cancer</li>\n\n<li>Gastrointestinal cancers</li>\n\n<li>Multiple myeloma</li>\n\n<li>Osteosarcoma and soft tissue sarcomas</li>\n\n<li>Ovarian cancer</li>\n\n<li>Pancreatic cancer</li>\n\n<li>Prostate cancer</li>\n\n<li>Gallbladder and biliary tract cancer</li>\n\n<li>Cervical cancer</li>\n\n<li>Testicular cancer</li>\n\n<li>Thyroid cancer</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-group medlux-section has-global-padding is-layout-constrained wp-block-group-is-layout-constrained\">\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Before you travel</h2>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">To get a reliable medical opinion quickly, please prepare:</p>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li>Recent medical reports and discharge summaries</li>\n\n<li>Imaging (MRI, CT, X-ray) on CD or as DICOM files, with the radiology reports</li>\n\n<li>Recent laboratory results</li>\n\n<li>A list of your current medications and any allergies</li>\n\n<li>Pathology report and, if available, tissue blocks or slides</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-group medlux-section has-global-padding is-layout-constrained wp-block-group-is-layout-constrained\">\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">How MedLuxLife supports you</h2>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-group medlux-steps is-layout-grid wp-container-core-group-is-layout-5e4b10ce wp-block-group-is-layout-grid\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-group medlux-card has-global-padding is-layout-constrained wp-block-group-is-layout-constrained\">\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">1. Free consultation</h3>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Share your wishes and, if available, recent X-rays or photos. We answer your questions and explain the options.</p>\n</div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-group medlux-card has-global-padding is-layout-constrained wp-block-group-is-layout-constrained\">\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">2. Personal treatment plan</h3>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Our partner specialists prepare a treatment plan and an estimated timeline tailored to you.</p>\n</div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-group medlux-card has-global-padding is-layout-constrained wp-block-group-is-layout-constrained\">\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">3. Travel &amp; treatment</h3>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">We coordinate your appointments, hotel and airport transfers, so you can focus on your treatment.</p>\n</div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-group medlux-card has-global-padding is-layout-constrained wp-block-group-is-layout-constrained\">\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">4. Aftercare</h3>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">We stay in touch after you return home and help with follow-up questions.</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-group medlux-cta has-global-padding is-layout-constrained wp-block-group-is-layout-constrained\">\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Plan your oncology consultation with confidence</h2>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Every treatment begins with a personal, no-obligation consultation. Contact us and we will get back to you as soon as possible.</p>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-buttons is-layout-flex wp-block-buttons-is-layout-flex\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-button medlux-btn-primary\"><a class=\"wp-block-button__link wp-element-button\" href=\"https://medluxlife.de/contact/\">Request a Free Consultation</a></div>\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-button medlux-btn-whatsapp\"><a class=\"wp-block-button__link wp-element-button\" href=\"https://wa.me/380979092326\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">WhatsApp</a></div>\n</div>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"medlux-disclaimer wp-block-paragraph\">The information on this page is for general guidance only and does not replace a medical consultation. Suitability for any treatment is assessed individually by a qualified doctor.</p>\n</div>\n", "protected": false, "block_version": 1}, "excerpt": {"raw": "", "rendered": "<p>Cancer treatment is planned according to the type, stage and biological features of the disease and your personal situation. Through our partner hospital, your case is assessed by a multidisciplinary team in which medical oncologists work closely with surgeons, radiation oncologists and other specialists. Treatments and services Personal treatment planning A treatment plan tailored to [&hellip;]</p>\n", "protected": false}, "author": 2, "featured_media": 0, "parent": 259, "menu_order": 1, "comment_status": "closed", "ping_status": "closed", "template": "page-with-title", "meta": {"footnotes": ""}, "permalink_template": "https://medluxlife.de/health/hospital-specialist-treatments/%pagename%/", "generated_slug": "medical-oncology", "class_list": ["post-268", "page", "type-page", "status-publish", "hentry"], "_links": {"self": [{"href": "https://medluxlife.de/wp-json/wp/v2/pages/268", "targetHints": {"allow": ["GET", "POST", "PUT", "PATCH", "DELETE"]}}], "collection": [{"href": "https://medluxlife.de/wp-json/wp/v2/pages"}], "about": [{"href": "https://medluxlife.de/wp-json/wp/v2/types/page"}], "author": [{"embeddable": true, "href": "https://medluxlife.de/wp-json/wp/v2/users/2"}], "replies": [{"embeddable": true, "href": "https://medluxlife.de/wp-json/wp/v2/comments?post=268"}], "version-history": [{"count": 3, "href": "https://medluxlife.de/wp-json/wp/v2/pages/268/revisions"}], "predecessor-version": [{"id": 415, "href": "https://medluxlife.de/wp-json/wp/v2/pages/268/revisions/415"}], "up": [{"embeddable": true, "href": "https://medluxlife.de/wp-json/wp/v2/pages/259"}], "wp:attachment": [{"href": "https://medluxlife.de/wp-json/wp/v2/media?parent=268"}], "wp:action-publish": [{"href": "https://medluxlife.de/wp-json/wp/v2/pages/268"}], "wp:action-unfiltered-html": [{"href": "https://medluxlife.de/wp-json/wp/v2/pages/268"}], "wp:action-assign-author": [{"href": "https://medluxlife.de/wp-json/wp/v2/pages/268"}], "curies": [{"name": "wp", "href": "https://api.w.org/{rel}", "templated": true}]}}